The applicant will comply with all the terms and conditions of the bond executed by him/her;
ii. The applicant will cooperate in the investigation/trial, as the case may be; iii. The applicant will not indulge himself/herself in extending inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him/her from disclosing such facts to the Court or to the Police Officer, as the case may be;
iv.

